# {{PRODUCT_NAME}}

This standalone reinforcement-learning product was generated by RLSPL Studio.
It contains only the selected environment adapter, algorithm, action-selection
behavior, optimizer/update rule, training pipeline, evaluation pipeline, and run recorder.

## Install and run

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
python3 -m pip install -e .
python3 run.py
```

The root launcher makes the generated `src/` package discoverable and prints an
actionable installation command when a selected runtime dependency is missing.
After installation, `python3 -m rlspl_product` and `rlspl-run` are equivalent.

Use `--output PATH` to select the run directory parent and `--config PATH` to
run another compatible resolved configuration.

Every completed run contains its effective configuration, reward traces,
evaluation records, metrics, agent checkpoint, optional plots, and immutable
`run-metadata.json` provenance record. When HPO is enabled, the same command
executes all declared trials and search seeds, records live `hpo-summary.json`
and `hpo-trials.jsonl` evidence, selects the best aggregate objective, and then
fits the final agent for the independent evaluation seeds.
